"v3.0](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html). Source code is available "
"at [github.com/timriker/bzo](/source)."
msgstr ""
"Es software libre con licencia [GNU Affero General Public License v3.0]"
"(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html). El código fuente está "
"disponible en [github.com/timriker/bzo](/source)."
